          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Professor Otterbeck is set to publish a new book on the subject later this year.  In ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The Awakening of Islamic Pop Music",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ", he will expand on the history of nashid, Islamic discourse on popular music and the artists of the Islamic media company Awakening. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
